    "question": "Is Sermorelin the same as HGH?",
    "answer": "No. HGH is synthetic human growth hormone. Sermorelin supports signaling upstream in the body's own GH-axis."
  },
  {
    "question": "How is eligibility determined?",
    "answer": "Through consultation, medical history, medication review, and labs when appropriate."
  },
  {
    "question": "How is Sermorelin different from CJC-1295 / Ipamorelin?",
    "answer": "Sermorelin is often the entry point to GH-axis work. CJC-1295 / Ipamorelin is a stronger pairing for clients ready for a more pronounced overnight signal."
